em information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Intel(R) UHD Graphics 620 (Intel Corporation; 31.0.101.2127) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8365U CPU @ 1.60GHz (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n_What happens with the following as text input:\n[bgcolor=#F842]T[/bgcolor][bgcolor=#2F84]E[/bgcolor]\n[bgcolor=#42F8]S[/bgcolor][bgcolor=#842F]T[/bgcolor]_\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/350553d9-012e-4c85-aba8-2ca7d4c21c22)\n\n_[fgcolor=#F842]T[/fgcolor][fgcolor=#2F84]E[/fgcolor]\n[fgcolor=#42F8]S[/fgcolor][fgcolor=#842F]T[/fgcolor]_\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0d34c7a-ff52-41a4-87f5-e3d0a26981c1)\n\nWhen using bbcode in RichTextLabel, the \"bounding box\" of bgcolor & fgcolor is big enough that the highlights of text overlaps with other highlights of other text, as shown in screenshot. This happens with any font, including monospaced ones, and any size, but in the screenshots I'm just using the default (the one that gets shown when you don't specify a font theme override). The edge of the RichTextLabel node cuts of the \"overlap\" of the text at the edge\nIdeally, the borders of bgcolor & fgcolor should stop about in the middle of where they currently overlap, and be flush with each other.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. make a RichTextLabel node\n2. enter \"[bgcolor=(color1)]{text1}[/bgcolor][bgcolor=(color2)]{text2}[/bgcolor]\" in the Text input (text and color can be anything, colors should be different) (can do more than two text/colors, and/or seperate them with a line break)\n3. resize box so scroll bar doesn't show up\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104045/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}